# tally 2.2.1 S-223 (L §5.19: "A correction in a version that doesn't cover, on the row's day, a place of its legs
# that the replaced row's version covers is refused (`LOAD-COVERS`)"; the lead's P3, P21):
# a correction only: `replace bank[r2] = none` books nothing and needs no covers (P3, P21);
# mini5 without its r1 correction loads.
=== asks.tally
part asks4
  tally 2

ask q_mid: bal(konto, 2026-10-20)
ask q_oct: bal(konto, 2026-10-31)
ask q_resid: residuals konto 2026-10
ask q_why: explain bal(konto, 2026-10-30)
=== fix.tally
part fix
  tally 2

version statement_2026_10_fix
  cite bank_2026_10
  governs 2026-10
  known 2026-11-04
  replace bank[r2] = none
=== reality.tally
model mini
  tally 2
  on 2026-11-05
  start 2026-10-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "Założenia modelu"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind jobs
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input pay_dom: int
input salary[j in jobs, m in months]: money PLN question "Ile wynosi pensja?"

move wage[m in months, j in jobs over m]: wages
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount salary[j, m]

version home
  cite s
  governs 2026-10..
  known 2026-10-01
  jobs + [acme] lives 2020-02-01..
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa"
  salary[acme] = 7 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-10-01 start "wyciąg"
=== statement.tally
part statements
  tally 2

source bank_2026_10 "Wyciąg, październik 2026"

input bank: observed

version statement_2026_10
  cite bank_2026_10
  governs 2026-10
  known 2026-11-02
  covers konto
  anchor konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-10-10, kind: wages, leg cash from world to konto amount 7 000.00 PLN) "line 1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-10-12, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 120.00 PLN) "line 2"
  stated[konto] = 7 900.00 PLN at 2026-10-31 end "saldo końcowe"
=== expect
q_mid: 8 000.00 PLN
  open: wage[2026-10, acme]
  cut 2026-11-05
q_oct: 7 900.00 PLN
  anchor: konto 2026-10-31 end, stated 7 900.00 PLN, difference -100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-11-05
q_resid: residuals konto 2026-10
  2026-10 move wage: model 7 000.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -7 000.00 PLN
    expected but missing wage[2026-10, acme] on 2026-10-10: model 7 000.00 PLN
  2026-10 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed 7 000.00 PLN, difference 7 000.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r1] on 2026-10-10: observed 7 000.00 PLN
  2026-10 balance: model 8 000.00 PLN, observed 7 900.00 PLN, difference -100.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-10-31 end (anchored): booked 8 000.00 PLN, stated 7 900.00 PLN, gap -100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-11-05
q_why: 8 000.00 PLN
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-10-30
  from: opening home:opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN, 2026-10-01 start (version home, source s, locator "wyciąg")
  2026-10-10:
    bank[r1].cash (observed): +7 000.00 PLN
  open: wage[2026-10, acme]
  cut 2026-11-05
